 Soto Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/de-soto-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 145% of normal in April to May, then fell to 56% in September to October and 49% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 48% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
